The '''Valentine Cape''' is a personal [[cape]] that was briefly given to two players.

== Distribution ==
This cape was given to LolFoxy2 by a Mojang employee, Ekkelangelo{{cn}} who started to become friends with LolFoxy2 and resolved their migration problems with their alternative account.<ref>https://i.imgur.com/ZgROuy8.png</ref> It was promptly removed twenty minutes later after discovering its rarity.

It was also given to the player JoinGrave, presumably by accident, and then removed two days later.{{cn}}

